  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to create an academic program for formation of wood technology specialist and the creation of a centre for wood technologies in the Andin region. Three differents academics levels;3,5yrs, 5yrs and a series of postgraduate courses will constitute the programm.</narrative>
